                "loc": "DAN.7.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then I saw thrones, and seated on them were those to whom judgment was committed. Also I saw the souls of those who had been beheaded for their testimony to Jesus and for the word of God, and who had not worshiped the beast or its image and had not received its mark on their foreheads or their hands. They came to life, and reigned with Christ a thousand years. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of the dead did not come to life until the thousand years were ended. This is the first resurrection. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed and holy is he who shares in the first resurrection! Over such the second death has no power, but they shall be priests of God and of Christ, and they shall reign with him a thousand years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
